            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Auf der Couch liegen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Stretching)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "**Break bad habit (Auf der Couch liegen)**\n1. Make it invisible: Remove cues from your environment.\n2. Make it unattractive: Highlight the negative consequences.\n3. Make it difficult: Increase friction (e.g. delete apps).\n4. Make it unsatisfying: Create an immediate penalty.\n\n**Build good habit (Stretching)**\n1. Make it obvious: Place cues in plain sight.\n2. Make it attractive: Pair it with an action you want to do.\n3. Make it easy: Reduce friction (e.g. 2-minute rule).\n4. Make it satisfying: Reward yourself immediately."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.doener_dauerkarte.desc": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Widerstehe der Versuchung an jeder Ecke und wähle gesunde Alternativen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resist the temptation at every corner and choose healthy alternatives."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resiste la tentación en cada esquina y elige alternativas saludables."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Résiste à la tentation à chaque coin de rue et choisis des alternatives saines."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resisti alla tentazione ad ogni angolo e scegli alternative sane."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あらゆる誘惑に負けず、健康的な代替品を選びましょう。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "모든 유혹을 이겨내고 건강한 대안을 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weersta de verleiding op elke hoek en kies voor gezonde alternatieven."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Odprzej pokusę na każdym kroku i wybierz zdrowe alternatywy."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Resista à tentação em cada esquina e escolha alternativas saudáveis."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Her köşedeki cazibeye direnin ve sağlıklı alternatifleri seçin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "trash.doener_dauerkarte.impact": {
      "comment": "",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Gewohnheit (Zu viel Fast Food) kostet dich langfristig Energie, Zeit und Geld. Sie hindert dich daran, dein volles Potenzial auszuschöpfen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
